*       ev_defer_int_lit — DEFERRED EXPRESSION WITH A LEADING INTEGER LITERAL.
*       s113 witness for the EMITTER-side union-tag defect (emit.cpp IR_SAVE_RESTORE
*       role-3 shim read IR_LIT(gamma).sval on an IR_LIT_INTEGER node).  NO EVAL HERE:
*       the crash was at COMPILE time, in the emitter, before this program ever ran.
        E = *(1)
        OUTPUT = DATATYPE(E)
END
